    :printedText """When this enchantment enters, exile target nonland permanent an opponent controls with mana value 2 or less until this enchantment leaves the battlefield."""@en ;
    :oracleText """When this enchantment enters, exile target nonland permanent an opponent controls with mana value 2 or less until this enchantment leaves the battlefield."""@en ;
    :flavorText """Drix hunt down Eldrazi Potentiate without hesitation or explanation."""@en ;
