        :rulingDate "2025-07-25"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """If a replacement effect (such as that of Exalted Sunborn’s second ability) causes additional tokens to be created during the resolution of Kav Landseeker’s last ability, you’ll sacrifice those tokens at the beginning of the end step on your next turn as well."""@en ] .

